  "description": "Allows you to partially (for example, only models) or completely generate a native (without dependencies) C# client sdk according to the OpenAPI specification. Inspired by NSwag. Uses IncrementalGenerators for efficient generation and caching.",
  "iconFile": "nuget_icon.png",
